Speaking to an enthusiastic crowd, he added: “I want politicians who are about to swirl Brexit will have to feel the pressure from you.”
“We’re going to mobilize an army of citizens of this country who gave us victory in the Brexit vote, and we won’t rest until Great Britain is once again an independent, self-governed and proud state.”
