He stood still and ensured that Batik Air's flight 6321, which was currently on the runway, was safely able to get into the air.
He then jumped out of the air traffic control tower, which he thought was about to collapse.
He later died in the hospital.
“Air Navigation Indonesia spokeswoman Yohannes Sirait said Agung’s decision may have saved hundreds of lives.
